## Occupational Health and Safety Management Policy

Archi establishes 8 main policies in the management of occupational health and safety, namely:

1. Implementing the Mining Safety Management System in accordance with the Decree of the Minister of Energy and Mineral Resources No. 1827 K/30/MEM/2018, Appendix IV, and ISO 45001:2018 standards, while pursuing continuous improvement through internal and external audits;
