6. Executing mining operational safety to prevent asset damage, halt risky production, and ensure efficient and productive mining operations;
7. Providing consultation and participation facilities for employees, contractors, and employee representatives;
8. Encouraging all employees and contractors to apply and manage mining safety practices; and
9. Creating a safe, healthy, efficient, and productive workplace to prevent injuries and health disturbances in accordance with the company's objectives, metrics, context, and the specific nature of mining safety risks and opportunities.

